  "vibe": "A #23262b factory floor lit by safety orange #ff7a1a and #ffd23c warning yellow. Chakra Petch caps over IBM Plex Sans, tracked two hundredths. The world runs a conveyor: eight steel rollers and three scored orange crates travel right at 120px per second, a steel arm bolted at the right swings its gripper 26° on a 1.1Hz sine, a beacon hard-blinks on a square wave with no fade at all, and a dashed hazard rule marches along the bottom edge. The camera shears four degrees as it moves — notably, it skews — and titles slam. Mechanics: a code diff, drag-to-assemble, a rotary dial and an arc gauge. The closing beat floods full orange. Best for manufacturing, robotics, hardware, devtools and operations.",
